The `getExpectedFileHashFromConfigManager` method needs to be implemented by yourself, it should retrieve the expected hash value for a given URL from your configuration manager or another suitable source.

Please note that this implementation does not include any form of error handling or exception management beyond logging, which may need to be expanded upon in a real-world application.
